00:58:37.930 --> 00:58:41.760
<v Erin Einhorn>Oh my God, wow. Really? You're a Jew? Wow, that's so exciting.
<v Erin Einhorn>噢，我的天，哇。真的吗？你是犹太人？哇，那太令人激动了。

00:58:41.760 --> 00:58:56.070
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

